Description
Master repository documentation for beast-system-3.0, detailing the full sovereign Private Government ecosystem architecture, multi-module smart contract integration via BeastSystemBus, API microservices, PostgreSQL database schemas, and GCP Cloud Run deployment workflows.

Core Code
Markdown
# BEAST System 3.0 (`beast-system-3.0`)

`beast-system-3.0` is the central orchestration framework and sovereign governance hub for the **New World Order Private Government DAO LLC**. It serves as the unified coordination layer uniting all seven specialized Web3 administrative pillars into a sovereign, trustless, containerized cloud infrastructure.

---

## 🏛 Sovereign Ecosystem Division Overview

| Pillar Division | Repository | Core Role & Functionality |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Governance Hub** | `beast-system-3.0` | Central System Bus (`BeastSystemBus.sol`), DAO voting (`LucricityGovernor`), unified API gateway, and CI/CD orchestration. |
| **Social Welfare** | `beast-family-service` | Community mediation circles, voluntary family support funds, and peer elder dispute resolution. |
| **Judicial System** | `beast-legal-arbitration` | Escrow-backed dispute filing, voluntary private arbitration, and binding smart-contract verdicts. |
| **Property Registry** | `beast-land-registry` | Immutable real estate deed registration, boundary IPFS hashing, and cryptographic title transfers. |
| **Mutual Insurance** | `beast-micro-insurance` | Sovereign risk pooling, multi-assessor claim validation, and trustless automated payouts. |
| **Identity & License** | `beast-credential-registry` | Decentralized credentials (VCs), skill attestations, and cross-module permissions mapping. |
| **Commerce & Barter** | `beast-trade-exchange` | Peer-to-peer barter marketplace, multi-token price listings, and direct escrow trade settlements. |

---

## 🛠 System Architecture

```text
beast-system-3.0/
├── contracts/               # Core governance & integration smart contracts
│   ├── LucricityToken.sol   # Ecosystem governance token (LUCR)
│   ├── LucricityGovernor.sol# Multi-sig DAO voting & proposal contract
│   └── BeastSystemBus.sol   # Cross-contract credential & permission verifier
├── backend/                 # API Gateway & Cloud SQL synchronizer
│   ├── db/
│   │   └── schema.sql       # Relational PostgreSQL database tables
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── routes/          # Express API endpoints (/governance, /credentials, /trade)
│   │   ├── services/        # On-chain System Bus WebSocket listener
│   │   └── server.js        # Serverless Node.js entry point
│   └── Dockerfile           # Optimized Cloud Run container spec
├── frontend/                # Unified Web3 Next.js App Router gateway
│   └── src/app/             # Dashboard, SSO wallet connector, and module routes
├── .github/workflows/       # Automated GCP GitHub Actions CI/CD deployment pipeline
└── README.md                # System documentation
🚦 Quickstart & Deployment
1. Local Development Setup
Bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/PAT333-UX/beast-system-3.0.git](https://github.com/PAT333-UX/beast-system-3.0.git)
cd beast-system-3.0

# Install & Run Backend Express API
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev

# Install & Run Frontend Next.js Gateway
cd ../frontend
npm install
npm run dev
2. Environment Variables (backend/.env)
Code snippet
PORT=8080
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/beast_db
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=[https://rpc.sepolia.org](https://rpc.sepolia.org)
SYSTEM_BUS_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
3. Automated Deployment to GCP Cloud Run
Deployments are fully automated via GitHub Actions on main branch push using .github/workflows/deploy.yml.

Required GitHub Repository Secrets:

GCP_PROJECT_ID

GCP_SA_KEY

CLOUD_SQL_CONNECTION_NAME

DB_PASSWORD

PRIVATE_KEY
